OL,3,GNEWSABethnal Green's York Hall closed
OL,4,A'until next year'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe historic leisure centre and sports
OL,7,Farena York Hall in Bethnal Green, may
OL,8,Fnot reopen until next year, Tower
OL,9,FHamlets Council has said.
OL,11,FThe council closed the building in east
OL,12,FLondon after traces of the Legionella
OL,13,Fbacteria were found during testing on
OL,14,F15 July.
OL,16,FThe bacteria can cause Legionnaires
OL,17,Fdisease - a type of pneumonia - when
OL,18,Finhaled with water vapour or mist.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
