OL,3,GNEWSABethnal Green's York Hall closed
OL,4,A'until next year'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have been told the centre
OL,7,Fmay reopen in January. However one
OL,8,Fmanager said there was "a possibility
OL,9,Fthat that might not happen" if test
OL,10,Fresults remained positive.
